		content.push(localize('chat.generatedImages', "Image generation appears separately from thinking and tool-call groups. Copilot and Codex agent sessions share this presentation. Completed steps collapse only before the first image-generation tool, keeping image tools in their original position. While generation runs, expand the tool dropdown to inspect the submitted prompt. Its title says Generating image with the image model when the model is available, and does not shimmer. The image model can differ from the selected conversation model. A compact decorative band of shifting glyphs remains visible below the dropdown and reveals a single image when its bytes are available. The animation does not indicate a percentage complete and stays still when reduced motion is enabled or a high contrast theme is active. The reveal is skipped in those modes and when reopening a chat. Only the persistent progress line rotates through painting-themed phrases, without repeatedly announcing them. These phrases are decorative, not individual generation stages. Use Tab to focus the dropdown and Enter or Space to expand or collapse it. Successful generation shows the Generated image dropdown, including the image model when available, with a single image below it even when collapsed. If generation fails, the Generated image failed row can be expanded to inspect the error. Completed and failed image tools keep their final status when you reopen the chat. Image previews start loading as soon as generation succeeds, even if the response is still in progress. A preview is marked as busy while its bytes load. Unable to load image indicates a problem loading the preview, not a failed generation. Use Tab or Shift+Tab to focus an image and Enter to open it. Use the Save action to the right of the image to save generated images."));
		content.push(localize('chat.generatedImageBatch', "Each consecutive batch of image-generation calls has its own preview in conversation order. Select any thumbnail, including one still generating, to show its image or progress and its tool dropdown above the preview. Use Tab to focus the selected thumbnail, then Left or Right Arrow, Home, or End to select another image or its progress. Expand the selected tool dropdown to inspect its prompt and output, including timing and size. The selected thumbnail has a highlighted border. The thumbnail row follows the selected preview's size. Generating images show only the compact glyph band, while cancelled or failed images show their status in the tool dropdown without an empty preview. The Image batch status below the thumbnails shows how many images are ready out of the total, along with any that need attention, failed, or were cancelled. Later results arrive without changing your selection, and only the selected preview animates. Focus the main image and press Enter to open the carousel. Approval and authentication requests remain visible even when another image is selected."));
		content.push(localize('chat.generatedImageBatchDownload', "Use the download action beside the Image batch status to save all currently ready images as a ZIP archive. Use Tab to reach it and Enter or Space to download. The action is unavailable until an image is ready and while a download is in progress. Only images ready when you start the download are included; failed, cancelled, and pending images are not included."));
		content.push(localize('chat.generatedImagePreparation', "Image-generation tool entries, previews, and batch counts stay hidden while the model assembles the tool arguments. If approval is required, the confirmation is the first tool UI shown. Generating image, the glyph animation, painting progress phrases, and the painting pet start only when the tool executes, after any required confirmation. Confirmation and authentication waits pause image-generation progress."));
		content.push(localize('chat.generatedImageCancellation', "Stopping image generation shows Image generation cancelled, not a generation error. Cancelled image tools keep their cancelled status when you reopen the chat."));
		content.push(localize('chat.generatedImageCarousel', "Generated images also appear in artifacts. When Images Preview is enabled for chat, opening an image lets you browse generated images, user-attached images, and images shown in responses from the same conversation. Use the Left and Right Arrow keys to move between images."));
		content.push(localize('chat.responseImages', "To open an image shown in a response, use Tab to focus it and press Enter or Space. To attach it to your next request, open its context menu{0} and choose Add File to Chat, or drag it into the chat input.", '<keybinding:editor.action.showContextMenu>'));
